<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %><c:set var="pageTitle" value="Bulk Identity Import"/><!doctype html><html><head><%@ include file="../common/head.jspf" %></head><body><div class="app-shell"><%@ include file="../common/sidebar.jspf" %><main class="main"><%@ include file="../common/topbar.jspf" %><div class="content"><%@ include file="../common/flash.jspf" %><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="panel p-4"><h2 class="fw-bold">Import enrollee records</h2><p class="text-secondary">Upload a UTF-8 CSV with the exact required header. Every successful row receives an independent random QR token.</p><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="mt-4"><label class="form-label">CSV file (maximum 2 MB)</label><input class="form-control form-control-lg" type="file" name="csv" accept=".csv,text/csv" required><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-arrow-up me-2"></i>Validate and Import</button></form></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="panel p-4"><h5 class="fw-bold">Required columns</h5><code class="d-block bg-light p-3 rounded mt-3">identity_no, full_name, email, person_type, department, course, valid_from, valid_until</code><ul class="text-secondary mt-3"><li>Dates use YYYY-MM-DD.</li><li>person_type is STUDENT or STAFF.</li><li>Identity numbers and QR tokens must be unique.</li><li>Add photos afterward from the edit page.</li></ul><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/sample-identities.csv" download><i class="fa-solid fa-download me-2"></i>Download sample</a></div></div></div></div></main></div><%@ include file="../common/scripts.jspf" %></body></html>
